(262, 'en', 'What is the Genuine Alternator Spares?', 'what is the genuine alternator spares', 'Genuine Alternator Spares — Stamford: Alternator components for generator sets built with Stamford and Leroy-Somer alternators.\n[Genuine Alternator Spares page](/model.html?p=alternator-parts&lang=en)\nWant a quotation? tap the “Talk to a person” button below or use the quote request on the site.', 'facts', 'new', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-10 16:57:47', '2026-10-24 02:00:46'),
(263, 'en', 'What are the specifications of the Genuine Alternator Spares?', 'what are the specifications of the genuine alternator spares', 'Key specifications of the Genuine Alternator Spares:\n- Supported alternator brands: Stamford (Cummins Generator Technologies), Leroy-Somer\n- Component range: Automatic Voltage Regulators (AVR), rotating rectifier diodes, surge suppressors, bearings\n- Testing standard: Factory calibrated and pre-tested to OEM factory specifications\n[Genuine Alternator Spares page](/model.html?p=alternator-parts&lang=en)\nWant a quotation? tap the “Talk to a person” button below or use the quote request on the site.', 'facts', 'new', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-10 16:57:47', '2026-10-24 02:00:46'),
(264, 'en', 'What are the advantages of the Genuine Alternator Spares?', 'what are the advantages of the genuine alternator spares', 'What sets the Genuine Alternator Spares apart:\n- Original genuine AVRs (SX460, AS440, MX321, R250, R438, R450)\n- Guarantees precision voltage regulation (±0.5% – ±1.0%) under heavy step loads\n- Supplied with expert wiring diagrams and configuration support by 5A&M engineers\n- Direct bolt-on replacement minimizing diagnostic and commissioning time\n[Genuine Alternator Spares page](/model.html?p=alternator-parts&lang=en)\nWant a quotation? tap the “Talk to a person” button below or use the quote request on the site.', 'facts', 'new', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-10 16:57:47', '2026-10-24 02:00:46'),
