(268, 'en', 'Technical specs for the Heavy Equipment & Excavator Maintenance Kits?', 'technical specs for the heavy equipment excavator maintenance kits', 'Key specifications of the Heavy Equipment & Excavator Maintenance Kits:\n- Supported machinery: Develon & Doosan crawler excavators, wheel excavators, wheel loaders\n- Component scope: Hydraulic return/pilot filters, engine consumables, track pins, seal kits\n- Sourcing: Genuine factory direct import\n[Heavy Equipment & Excavator Maintenance Kits page](/model.html?p=heavy-equipment-parts&lang=en)\nFor full details or a quotation, tap the “Talk to a person” button below.', 'facts', 'new', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-10 16:57:48', '2026-10-24 02:00:46'),
