(289, 'en', 'Tell me about your Environmental Solutions', 'tell me about your environmental solutions', 'Elgin, Vactor and Guzzler equipment supplied in Egypt by 5A&M, the exclusive authorized dealer for Federal Signal Environmental Solutions Group.\n[Environmental Solutions](/environment.html?lang=en)\nWant a quotation? tap the “Talk to a person” button below or use the quote request on the site.', 'facts', 'new', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-10 16:57:48', '2026-10-24 02:00:46'),
