(300, 'en', 'Tell me about your Projects', 'tell me about your projects', 'Generator installation, repowering, canopy fabrication, fuel systems, control panels and field service delivered by 5A&M.\n[Projects](/projects.html?lang=en)\nFor full details or a quotation, tap the “Talk to a person” button below.', 'facts', 'new', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-10 16:57:48', '2026-10-24 02:00:46'),
