_en":"Acoustic-enclosed diesel generator sets","brand_id":1,"category":"power","position":5,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","hero_image":"assets/img/photos/genset-workshop.jpg","updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","subcategory":"Generator Sets","description_ar":"مولدات ديزل صناعية للخدمة الشاقة بكابينة عازلة للصوت من 10 إلى 2500 kVA، مصممة للمستشفيات، والمراكز التجارية والمشروعات السكنية حيث الهدوء مطلوب.","description_en":"Heavy-duty acoustic-enclosed diesel generator sets from 10 to 2500 kVA, engineered for residential, commercial and hospital facilities where low decibel operation is essential."}', 1, '2026-10-01 02:22:51'),
