"title":{"ar":"حلول البيئة","en":"Environmental solutions"},"cardCta":{"ar":"استعرض الخدمة","en":"Learn more"},"eyebrow":{"ar":"وكالة حصرية معتمدة","en":"EXCLUSIVE AUTHORIZED DEALER"},"brandPage":{"elgin":"environment.html#elgin","vactor":"environment.html#vactor","guzzler":"environment.html#guzzler"},"dealerLabel":{"ar":"وكيل حصري في مصر","en":"Exclusive dealer in Egypt"}},"page_id":17,"position":2,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:13.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T20:03:17.000Z"}', 1, '2026-10-01 04:05:42'),
