(28, 'section', 20, '{"id":20,"type":"story","anchor":"team","content":{"img":"assets/img/photos/field-service.jpg","tag":{"ar":"زيارة خدمة ميدانية","en":"Service field visit"},"note":{"d":{"ar":"أن يطابق قولُنا فعلَنا؛ فخدماتنا يجب أن تكون كفؤة وفعّالة، لنكسب رضا عملائنا بتقديم أفضل الحلول.","en":"To “walk the talk”: our services must be efficient and effective, to gain customer satisfaction by providing the best solutions."},"t":{"ar":"رسالتنا","en":"Our mission"}},"text":{"ar":"فريق خدمة ما بعد البيع لدينا مدرَّب ومخصَّص لتقديم دعم مستمر لعملائنا؛ يضمن سرعة الاستجابة وحل المشكلات بفعالية، ويحافظ على رضا العملاء والدعم على المدى الطويل.","en":"Our well-trained after-sales team is dedicated to providing continuous support to our clients — ensuring a quick response and an effective solution to every issue, and maintaining customer satisfaction and long-term support."},"title":{"ar":"فريق خدمة ما بعد البيع","en":"The after-sales team"}},"page_id":7,"position":0,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z"}', 1, '2026-10-01 04:06:40'),
(29, 'section', 31, '{"id":31,"type":"vmv","anchor":"vmv","content":{"cards":[{"d":{"ar":"أن نصبح شركة رائدة في السوق المصري في مجال توليد الطاقة والمعدات الصناعية، من خلال محفظة من أفضل التوكيلات، عبر تقديم منتجات عالية الجودة وحلول فنية موثوقة لعملائنا في مختلف القطاعات.","en":"To become a leading company in the Egyptian market for power generation and industrial equipment, through a portfolio of top agencies, by delivering high-quality products and reliable technical solutions to our clients across various sectors."},"t":{"ar":"الرؤية","en":"Vision"},"icon":"eye"},{"d":{"ar":"أن يطابق قولُنا فعلَنا، فخدماتنا يجب أن تكون كفؤة وفعّالة لكسب رضا العملاء من خلال تقديم أفضل الحلول.","en":"To “walk the talk”: our services must be efficient and effective, to gain customer satisfaction by providing the best solutions."},"t":{"ar":"الرسالة","en":"Mission"},"icon":"target"},{"d":{"ar":"نقدّم منتجات وخدمات تلبّي أعلى المعايير الدولية، وتضمن المتانة والاعتمادية، وتواكب التقنيات الحديثة والحلول المبتكرة لرفع الكفاءة.","en":"We deliver products and services that meet the highest international standards, ensuring durability and reliability, and embracing new technologies and creative solutions to enhance efficiency."},"t":{"ar":"القيم","en":"Values"},"icon":"gem"}],"title":{"ar":"رؤية ورسالة وقيم 5A&M","en":"5A&M Vision, Mission and Values"}},"page_id":10,"position":1,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T23:31:16.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T23:31:16.000Z"}', 1, '2026-10-01 04:06:44'),
(30, 'section', 53, '{"id":53,"type":"linecard","anchor":"environmental","content":{"idx":"01","lede":{"ar":"⁦5A&M⁩ هي الوكيل الحصري المعتمد في مصر لمجموعة Federal Signal Environmental Solutions. المجموعات الثلاث تحت بتغطي كنس الشوارع وتنظيف الصرف الصحي والبنية التحتية وأعمال الشفط الصناعي — بتوريد وتشغيل وخدمة من نفس الفريق.","en":"5A&M is the exclusive authorised dealer in Egypt for Federal Signal Environmental Solutions Group. The three ranges below cover street sweeping, sewer and infrastructure cleaning, and industrial vacuum work — supplied, commissioned and serviced by the same team."},"tone":"paper","title":{"ar":"ثلاث وكالات، وجهة تواصل واحدة","en":"Three agencies, one point of contact"},"anchor":"environmental","eyebrow":{"ar":"المعدات البيئية","en":"Environmental Equipment"},"deciding":["Capacity","Hopper capacity","Debris body capacity","Water capacity","Maximum sweep path","Sweep path","Pump performance","Blower performance","Vacuum performance","Rating","Item range","Brands supported","Brands supplied"],"brandBlocks":[{"subs":["Mechanical Sweepers","Regenerative Air","Vacuum Sweepers"],"blurb":{"ar":"مكانس شوارع مبنية على تصاميم بيجري تطويرها باستمرار من 1914. فرشاة ميكانيكية أو هواء متجدد أو شفط خالص — والاختيار بيتحدد حسب نوع المخلفات والمسار وقواعد الأتربة اللي بتشتغل تحتها.","en":"Street sweepers built on designs continuously improved since 1914. Mechanical broom, regenerative air and pure vacuum — the choice depends on the debris, the route and the dust rules you work under."},"brand":"elgin"},{"subs":["Combination Units","Catch Basin Cleaners","Sewer Cleaners","Water Recyclers"],"blurb":{"ar":"منظفات صرف صحي مركّبة وماكينات بيارات التصريف وأجهزة نفث مائي. ولما الشاسيه ميقدرش يوصل للخط مباشرة، ماكينة الخطوط الخلفية بتقدر.","en":"Combination sewer cleaners, catch basin machines and water jetters. Where a truck cannot reach the line directly, the easement machine can."},"brand":"vactor"},{"subs":["Industrial Vacuums","High-Capacity Units","Wet/Dry Units","Custom Solutions"],"blurb":{"ar":"شفاطات تحميل صناعية للمواد الصلبة والمساحيق والسوائل والحمأة الكثيفة — وفيها وحدات مجهّزة لموقع واحد أو لمادة واحدة بعينها.","en":"Industrial vacuum loaders for solids, powders, liquids and thick sludge — including units configured for a single site or a single material."},"brand":"guzzler"}]},"page_id":20,"position":1,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:13.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:13.000Z"}', 1, '2026-10-01 04:06:48'),
(31, 'section', 55, '{"id":55,"type":"linecard","anchor":"parts","content":{"idx":"03","lede":{"ar":"قطع غيار محركات ومولدات كهربائية ووحدات تحكم وقطع كهربائية وفلاتر، للمعدات اللي بنوردّها ولأساطيل إحنا مبعناهاش. محفوظة في مخزون دائم، لأن قطعة بتوصل بعد تلات أسابيع مش قطعة غيار.","en":"Engine, alternator, controller, electrical and filtration parts for the equipment we supply and for fleets we did not sell. Held in stocked inventory, because a part that arrives in three weeks is not a spare part."},"tone":"paper","title":{"ar":"قطع غيار أصلية، موجودة على الرف","en":"Genuine parts, on the shelf"},"anchor":"parts","groups":[{"style":"rows","title":{"ar":"القطع والفلاتر اللي بنحتفظ بيها","en":"Parts and filtration we hold"},"category":"parts"}],"eyebrow":{"ar":"قطع الغيار","en":"Spare Parts"},"deciding":["Capacity","Hopper capacity","Debris body capacity","Water capacity","Maximum sweep path","Sweep path","Pump performance","Blower performance","Vacuum performance","Rating","Item range","Brands supported","Brands supplied"],"brandCells":["perkins","cummins","hyundai","volvo","develon","stamford","leroysomer","dse","comap","fleetguard","schneider"]},"page_id":20,"position":3,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:13.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:50:36.000Z"}', 1, '2026-10-01 04:06:53'),
(32, 'page', 7, '{"id":7,"hero":{"img":"assets/img/photos/genset-workshop.jpg","lede":{"ar":"فريق ما بعد بيع مدرَّب، وقطع غيار أصلية من المخزون، وصيانة في الموقع بعقود صيانة، وضمان قوي على كل مولد نسلّمه.","en":"A trained after-sales team, genuine spare parts from stock, on-site maintenance under contract, and a solid warranty on every generator we deliver."},"title":{"ar":"خدمات ما بعد البيع","en":"After-sales services"},"kicker":{"ar":"دعم يستمر بعد التسليم","en":"Support beyond delivery"}},"slug":"aftersales","noindex":0,"related":["parts","maintenance"],"crumb_ar":"خدمات ما بعد البيع","crumb_en":"After-sales services","og_image":"https://www.5a-eg.com/assets/img/photos/genset-5am-canopy.jpg","position":6,"template":"sections","title_ar":null,"title_en":"After-sales services — 5A&M","published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","parent_slug":null,"redirect_to":null,"description_ar":null,"description_en":"After-sales and field service teams, emergency breakdown response and warranty support.","quote_solution":"service"}', 1, '2026-10-01 04:09:04'),
(33, 'page', 2, '{"id":2,"hero":{"img":"assets/img/range/genset-canopy.jpg","lede":{"ar":"بيع وإيجار المولدات، وأعمال رفع الكفاءة والعمرات الشاملة، وأعمال الصناعة والتركيبات بفريقنا.","en":"Generator sales and rental, efficiency upgrades and full overhauls, and fabrication and installation by our own team."},"title":{"ar":"حلول الطاقة","en":"Power Solutions"},"kicker":{"ar":"نطاق العمل","en":"Scope of work"}},"slug":"power","noindex":0,"related":null,"crumb_ar":"حلول الطاقة","crumb_en":"Power Solutions","og_image":"https://www.5a-eg.com/assets/img/photos/genset-5am-canopy.jpg","position":1,"template":"sections","title_ar":null,"title_en":"Power Solutions — 5A&M","published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","parent_slug":null,"redirect_to":null,"description_ar":null,"description_en":"Generator sales and rental, overhauls, fabrication, installation, spare parts and maintenance by 5A&M.","quote_solution":"power"}', 1, '2026-10-01 04:09:08'),
