ي","en":"Farms & irrigation"},{"ar":"رفع الكفاءة","en":"Efficiency upgrades"},{"ar":"قطع غيار وفلاتر","en":"Parts & filters"}]},{"d":{"ar":"مولدات ولوحات كهربائية وتركيب وصيانة للمنشآت الصناعية والمواقع التجارية والمؤسسات، إلى جانب التنظيف والشفط الصناعي.","en":"Generators, electrical panels, installation and maintenance for industrial facilities, commercial sites and institutions, plus industrial cleaning and vacuum."},"h":{"ar":"مشروعات قطاع الصناعة","en":"Industry projects"},"img":"assets/img/photos/card-sector-industry.jpg","sub":{"ar":"الصناعة","en":"Industry"},"who":{"ar":"5A&M · Schneider Electric · ABB","en":"5A&M · Schneider Electric · ABB"},"href":"projects.html#industry","lines":[{"ar":"مولدات ولوحات","en":"Generators & panels"},{"ar":"تركيب بالموقع","en":"On-site installation"},{"ar":"عقود صيانة","en":"Maintenance contracts"}]}],"title":{"ar":"مشروعاتنا في القطاعات","en":"Our projects by sector"},"anchor":"projects","cardCta":{"ar":"استعرض الخدمة","en":"Learn more"},"eyebrow":{"ar":"من أعمالنا","en":"OUR WORK"}},"page_id":17,"position":6,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:13.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:13.000Z"}]}}', 1, '2026-10-03 05:59:11'),
