(145, 'section', 21, '{"id":21,"type":"story","anchor":"parts","content":{"img":"assets/img/photos/filters-range.jpg","tag":{"ar":"فلاتر وقطع أصلية","en":"Genuine filters & parts"},"flip":true,"text":{"ar":"نوفّر جميع قطع الغيار الأصلية ونضمن توافرها من خلال مخزون دائم، وندعم كل متطلبات الصيانة والعمرات، ونقلّل فترات توقف المعدات بتوريد سريع وفعّال — من فلاتر Develon وFleetguard إلى قطع غيار محركات Hyundai وPerkins وCummins وVolvo.","en":"We provide all genuine spare parts and keep them available through stocked inventory, support every maintenance and overhaul requirement, and minimise equipment downtime through efficient parts delivery — from Develon and Fleetguard filters to parts for Hyundai, Perkins, Cummins and Volvo engines."},"title":{"ar":"قطع الغيار الأصلية","en":"Genuine spare parts"}},"page_id":7,"position":1,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z"}', 1, '2026-10-04 10:32:19'),
(146, 'section', 22, '{"id":22,"type":"story","anchor":"maintenance","content":{"cta":{"href":"maintenance.html","label":{"ar":"اعرف المزيد","en":"Learn more"}},"img":"assets/img/photos/site-installation.jpg","tag":{"ar":"في موقعك","en":"On your site"},"text":{"ar":"فريق الخدمة الميدانية يحافظ على معداتك تعمل في مكانها: صيانة دورية ووقائية وتصحيحية في موقعك، وتشخيص الأعطال في الموقع، واستجابة سريعة للأعطال الطارئة. ومن خلال عقد الصيانة يتم كل ذلك وفق جدول محدد، بقطع غيار أصلية ودعم فني مستمر.","en":"Our field service team keeps your equipment running where it works: periodic, preventive and corrective maintenance at your site, on-site troubleshooting and emergency breakdown response. Under a maintenance contract, all of it runs on a set schedule, with genuine parts and continuous technical support."},"title":{"ar":"صيانة المواقع وعقود الصيانة","en":"Site maintenance & maintenance contracts"}},"page_id":7,"position":2,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z"}', 1, '2026-10-04 10:32:19'),
(147, 'section', 23, '{"id":23,"type":"story","anchor":"warranty","content":{"img":"assets/img/photos/genset-5am-canopy.jpg","tag":{"ar":"حلول طاقة موثوقة","en":"Reliable power solution"},"flip":true,"text":{"ar":"جميع المولدات والخدمات التي نسلّمها مدعومة بضمان قوي يغطي عيوب التصنيع، ويضمن دعمًا فنيًا سريعًا وتوافر قطع الغيار وخدمة ما بعد بيع موثوقة — لضمان استمرارية أداء الطاقة.","en":"Every generator and service we deliver is backed by a solid warranty covering manufacturing defects — with prompt technical support, spare parts availability and reliable after-sales service to keep your power running."},"title":{"ar":"الضمان","en":"Warranty"}},"page_id":7,"position":3,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z"}', 1, '2026-10-04 10:32:19'),
