 (Regenerative Air) أداءً قويًا ومرونة عالية في أعمال الكنس والتنظيف.\\r\\nتتميز الجين Crosswind بكفاءة عالية في تنظيف المساحات المرصوفة الواسعة، مثل الشوارع ومواقف السيارات ومدارج المطارات، مع قدرة ممتازة على المناورة بفضل تركيبها على شاسيه قصير.\\r\\nالمميزات:\\r\\n- وحدة  شفط عالية السرعة بتسع ريش مع هيكل مبطن بالمطاط لمتانة أعلى وعمر تشغيلي أطول.\\r\\n- نظام تبطين خزان المخلفات LifeLiner لإطالة عمر الخزان، وتعزيز متانته، وتسهيل عملية التفريغ.\\r\\n- مسار كنس بعرض 12 قدمًا (3,658 مم) مع رأس كنس بعرض 90 بوصة (2,286 مم) وفرشتين جانبيتين بنظام هيدروليكي مقاس 42 بوصة (1,067 مم).\\r\\n-  أداء شفط مُحسّن لالتقاط المخلفات الخفيفة وكبيرة الحجم بكفاءة، بما في ذلك المخلفات بجوار الأرصفة.","description_en":"Elgin Regenerative Air Sweepers deliver powerful performance and versatility across a wide range of sweeping and cleaning applications.\\r\\nThe Elgin Crosswind efficiently cleans large, paved areas such as streets, parking lots, and airport runways, while its short-wheelbase truck chassis provides excellent maneuverability.\\r\\nFeatures:\\r\\n- 9-vane high-velocity turbine fan with a rubber-lined housing for enhanced durability and extended service life.\\r\\n- LifeLiner hopper liner system for extended hopper life, durability, and smoother dumping.\\r\\n- 12-ft. (3,658 mm) sweep path with a 90-in. (2,286 mm) pickup head and dual 42-in. (1,067 mm) hydraulic side brooms.\\r\\n- Enhanced vacuum performance for efficient pickup of light and bulky debris, including curbside areas."}', 1, '2026-10-06 06:59:33'),
(267, 'product', 2, '{"id":2,"ref":"elgin-whirlwind","sku":null,"data":{"meta":[{"k":"Application","v":"Street Sweeping"},{"k":"Product Type","v":"Pure Vacuum Sweeper"}],"videos":[{"ar":"اختبار رفع الأحجار","en":"Street sweeper rock demo","yt":"YR9GGTMsNog","len":"0:47","src":"assets/video/elgin/whirlwind/rock-show.mp4","poster":"assets/video/elgin/whirlwind/rock-show.jpg"},{"ar":"كيف يعمل نظام الطاقة المشتركة","en":"How SharedPower works","yt":"cPoRx_cwKmI","len":"0:55","src":"assets/video/elgin/whirlwind/shared-power.mp4","poster":"assets/video/elgin/whirlwind/shared-power.jpg"}],"gallery":["assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/hero.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g01.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g02.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g03.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g04.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g05.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g06.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g07.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g08.webp"],"related":["elgin-crosswind","elgin-pelican","vactor-2100i"],"features":["High-velocity vacuum pick-up for dense sand and debris","Wide sweep path with short wheelbase for tight urban navigation","Articulating side brooms with in-cab tilt control","Heavy-duty abrasion-resistant stainless steel hopper"],"downloads":[{"href":"assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/spec-sheet.pdf","label":"Whirlwind spec sheet (PDF)"},{"href":"assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/brochure.pdf","label":"Whirlwind brochure (PDF)"}],"applications":["Municipal roads and highways","Urban arterial thoroughfares","Construction site clean-up","Industrial compounds"],"specifications":[{"k":"Sweeping technology","v":"Pure vacuum — direct suction"},{"k":"Suction nozzle width","v":"813 mm (32 in)"},{"k":"Sweep path — nozzle + extension broom","v":"1,981 mm (78 in)"},{"k":"Sweep path — maximum","v":"3,658 mm (144 in)"},{"k":"Extension broom diameter","v":"406 mm (16 in)"},{"k":"Hopper volume","v":"6 m³ (8 cu yd)"},{"k":"Dump angle","v":"50°"},{"k":"Hopper floor angle","v":"10°"},{"k":"Hopper lifting","v":"Double-acting hydraulic cylinder"},{"k":"Auxiliary engine","v":"4.5 L — 74 hp (55 kW) @ 2400 rpm"},{"k":"Engine torque","v":"304 Nm (224 ft-lb) @ 1600 rpm"},{"k":"Shared Power System","v":"Patented — chassis boosts the auxiliary engine"},{"k":"Water tank capacity","v":"1,268 L (335 gal) — dual tanks"},{"k":"Spray system flow","v":"30 L/min — two pumps"},{"k":"Water pump","v":"Twin diaphragm, run-dry capability"},{"k":"Hydraulic system","v":"31 L/min per section — 87 L reservoir"},{"k":"Hydraulic filter","v":"10 micron spin-on, in-cab indicator"},{"k":"Electrical system","v":"12 V — 1000 CCA"},{"k":"Blower construction","v":"Hardox steel, 3.4 mm housing, rubber-lined"},{"k":"Chassis"}]},"slug":"elgin-whirlwind","name_ar":null,"name_en":"Whirlwind","type_ar":"مكنسة شوارع بالشفط الخالص مركّبة على شاسيه شاحنة","type_en":"Truck-mounted pure vacuum street sweeper","brand_id":2,"category":"environmental","position":1,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","hero_image":"assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/hero.webp","updated_at":"2026-09-30T23:22:41.000Z","subcategory":"Vacuum Sweepers","store_hidden":0,"description_ar":"مكنسة شوارع بالشفط الخالص عالية الأداء، بمسار كنس عريض وفوهة التقاط للخدمة الشاقة، مصمّمة للطرق غير المستوية والشوارع الرئيسية بالمدن.","description_en":"High-performance pure vacuum street sweeper with a wide sweeping path and heavy-duty pick-up nozzle, engineered for uneven roads and municipal thoroughfares."}', 1, '2026-10-06 07:03:00'),
(268, 'product', 2, '{"id":2,"ref":"elgin-whirlwind","sku":null,"data":{"meta":[{"k":"Application","v":"Street Sweeping"},{"k":"Product Type","v":"Pure Vacuum Sweeper"}],"videos":[{"ar":"اختبار رفع الأحجار","en":"Street sweeper rock demo","yt":"YR9GGTMsNog","len":"0:47","src":"assets/video/elgin/whirlwind/rock-show.mp4","poster":"assets/video/elgin/whirlwind/rock-show.jpg"},{"ar":"كيف يعمل نظام الطاقة المشتركة","en":"How SharedPower works","yt":"cPoRx_cwKmI","len":"0:55","src":"assets/video/elgin/whirlwind/shared-power.mp4","poster":"assets/video/elgin/whirlwind/shared-power.jpg"}],"gallery":["assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/hero.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g01.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g02.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g03.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g04.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g05.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g06.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g07.webp","assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/g08.webp"],"related":["elgin-crosswind","elgin-pelican","vactor-2100i"],"features":["High-velocity vacuum pick-up for dense sand and debris","Wide sweep path with short wheelbase for tight urban navigation","Articulating side brooms with in-cab tilt control","Heavy-duty abrasion-resistant stainless steel hopper"],"downloads":[{"href":"assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/spec-sheet.pdf","label":"Whirlwind spec sheet (PDF)"},{"href":"assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/brochure.pdf","label":"Whirlwind brochure (PDF)"}],"applications":["Municipal roads and highways","Urban arterial thoroughfares","Construction site clean-up","Industrial compounds"],"specifications":[{"k":"Sweeping technology","v":"Pure vacuum — direct suction"},{"k":"Suction nozzle width","v":"813 mm (32 in)"},{"k":"Sweep path — nozzle + extension broom","v":"1,981 mm (78 in)"},{"k":"Sweep path — maximum","v":"3,658 mm (144 in)"},{"k":"Extension broom diameter","v":"406 mm (16 in)"},{"k":"Hopper volume","v":"6 m³ (8 cu yd)"},{"k":"Dump angle","v":"50°"},{"k":"Hopper floor angle","v":"10°"},{"k":"Hopper lifting","v":"Double-acting hydraulic cylinder"},{"k":"Auxiliary engine","v":"4.5 L — 74 hp (55 kW) @ 2400 rpm"},{"k":"Engine torque","v":"304 Nm (224 ft-lb) @ 1600 rpm"},{"k":"Shared Power System","v":"Patented — chassis boosts the auxiliary engine"},{"k":"Water tank capacity","v":"1,268 L (335 gal) — dual tanks"},{"k":"Spray system flow","v":"30 L/min — two pumps"},{"k":"Water pump","v":"Twin diaphragm, run-dry capability"},{"k":"Hydraulic system","v":"31 L/min per section — 87 L reservoir"},{"k":"Hydraulic filter","v":"10 micron spin-on, in-cab indicator"},{"k":"Electrical system","v":"12 V — 1000 CCA"},{"k":"Blower construction","v":"Hardox steel, 3.4 mm housing, rubber-lined"},{"k":"Chassis"}]},"slug":"elgin-whirlwind","name_ar":null,"name_en":"Whirlwind","type_ar":"مكنسة شوارع بالشفط الخالص مركّبة على شاسيه شاحنة","type_en":"Truck-mounted pure vacuum street sweeper","brand_id":2,"category":"environmental","position":1,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","hero_image":"assets/img/elgin/whirlwind/hero.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-06T04:03:00.000Z","subcategory":"Vacuum Sweepers","store_hidden":0,"description_ar":"أحدثت الجين Whirlwind نقلة نوعية في أداء مكانس الشفط المثبتة على الشاحنات، بفضل تصميمها المتطور ومرونتها العالية. ويجمع تصميمها منخفض الصيانة وبين مسار كنس واسع وقاعدة عجلات قصيرة، مما يوفر قدرة فائقة على المناورة والتكيف مع مختلف التطبيقات.\\r\\nمنذ عام 1969، تواصل Whirlwind ريادتها في مجال مكانس الشفط، بفضل فوهة الشفط الفريدة وتصميمها القوي والمتين، لتوفر أداءً موثوقًا في مختلف تطبيقات تنظيف وصيانة الشوارع.\\r\\nالمميزات:\\r\\n- وحدة شفط عالية السرعة ذات تسع ريش مصنوعة من فولاذ Hardox لمتانة عالية وتدفق هواء قوي.\\r\\n- تدفق هواء عالي الحجم والسرعة لالتقاط المخلفات بكفاءة من المرور الأول.\\r\\n- فوهة شفط مقاومة للتآكل مقاس 32 بوصة (813 مم) لتنظيف أكثر كفاءة بجوار الأرصفة.\\r\\n- خزان مخلفات عالي السعة 8 ياردة³ (6 م³) مع حواجز من الفولاذ المقاوم للتآكل لتحميل المخلفات بكفاءة والاستفادة القصوى من السعة.\\r\\n- خزان مخلفات متين بجدران من فولاذ 10  درجات وأرضية بسُمك ¼ بوصة (6.35 مم) وزاوية تفريغ 50° لتفريغ سريع وكامل وسهولة التنظيف.","description_en":"The Elgin Whirlwind has revolutionized truck-mounted vacuum sweeping performance with its advanced design and exceptional flexibility. Its low-maintenance design combines a wide sweeping path with a short wheelbase, providing outstanding maneuverability and versatility across a wide range of applications.\\r\\nSince 1969, Whirlwind has remained at the forefront of the vacuum sweeping market, featuring a unique vacuum nozzle and robust, durable construction that delivers dependable performance across a variety of street cleaning and maintenance applications.\\r\\nFeatures:\\r\\n-High-velocity 9-vane Blower with Hardox® steel vanes. \\r\\n-High-volume, high-velocity airflow for efficient one-pass pickup.\\r\\n-32-inch (813 mm) abrasion-resistant suction nozzle for improved curbside cleaning.\\r\\n-8 yd³ (6 m³) high-capacity hopper with abrasion-resistant steel deflectors for efficient debris loading and maximum capacity utilization.\\r\\n-hopper with 10-gauge steel walls, a ¼-inch (6.35 mm) floor, and a 50° dump angle for fast, complete unloading and easy cleanup."}', 1, '2026-10-06 07:03:24'),
