dustrial brochure (PDF)"},{"href":"assets/img/elgin/pelican/waterless-sell-sheet.pdf","label":"Waterless Pelican sell sheet (PDF)"},{"href":"assets/img/elgin/pelican/spec-sheet-ecoinfused.pdf","label":"Eco-Infused spec sheet (PDF)"},{"href":"assets/img/elgin/pelican/quick-clean-panel.pdf","label":"Quick-Clean access panel (PDF)"}],"applications":["Historic & dense urban quarters","Residential neighbourhoods","Curb and gutter maintenance","Compacted sand and gravel collection"],"specifications":[{"k":"Sweeping technology","v":"Mechanical broom with vertical digger"},{"k":"Sweep path — one side broom","v":"2,438 mm (8 ft)"},{"k":"Sweep path — two side brooms","v":"3,048 mm (10 ft)"},{"k":"Hopper volume","v":"2.8 m³ (3.6 cu yd)"},{"k":"Maximum dump height","v":"2,896 mm (9 ft 6 in)"},{"k":"Hopper tilt time","v":"17 seconds"},{"k":"Design lift capacity","v":"4,080 kg (9,000 lb)"},{"k":"Dumping","v":"Frontal — standard"},{"k":"Engine output","v":"99 hp (74 kW) @ 2500 rpm"},{"k":"Fuel tank capacity","v":"132.5 L (35 gal)"},{"k":"Drive system","v":"Hydrostatic — single pedal forward/reverse"},{"k":"Travel speed","v":"Up to 32 km/h (20 mph)"},{"k":"Turning radius","v":"4,572 mm (15 ft) curb to curb"},{"k":"Weight — one side broom","v":"6,170 kg (13,590 lb)"},{"k":"Weight — two side brooms","v":"6,482 kg (14,290 lb)"},{"k":"Water tank capacity","v":"832 L (220 gal)"},{"k":"Hydraulic reservoir","v":"106 L (33 gal), externally readable"},{"k":"Front tyres","v":"11R22.5 14-ply"},{"k":"Cab","v":"Sealed, 100% filtered air, sound insulated, heated"},{"k":"Dust control"}]},"slug":"elgin-pelican","name_ar":null,"name_en":"Pelican","type_ar":"مكنسة شوارع ميكانيكية بثلاث عجلات وفرشاة دوّارة","type_en":"Mechanical Sweeper","brand_id":2,"category":"environmental","position":2,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","hero_image":"assets/img/elgin/pelican/hero.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-06T04:06:54.000Z","subcategory":"Mechanical Sweepers","store_hidden":0,"description_ar":"المعيار العالمي لمكانس الشوارع الميكانيكية بثلاث عجلات. قدرة مناورة لا تُضاهى، وتفريغ أمامي بارتفاع قابل للضبط، وأداء فرشاة ميكانيكية قوي.","description_en":"The Elgin Pelican broom sweeper is a three-wheel mechanical sweeper based on one of the original street sweeper designs, which has been continuously improved since 1914, meeting the highest sweeper standards. Maneuverability, visibility, economy, serviceability, and single-lane dumping with a sweep system that easily handles heavily compacted dirt and bulky debris are\\r\\nFeatures:\\r\\n• Market leader offering 360 degrees of operator visibility.\\r\\n• Rear steer for outstanding maneuverability.\\r\\n• Front mounted, variable high dump 3.6 yd3 (2.8 m3) hopper.\\r\\n• Elgin exclusive chevron conveyor belt.\\r\\n• Access to service points is simple with most accessible from ground level.\\r\\n• The unit is equipped with a combination of in-cab and site gauges to monitor."}', 1, '2026-10-06 07:09:11');
