ols, with the manoeuvrability to work in tight spaces."}', 1, '2026-10-06 11:15:21'),
(275, 'product', 31, '{"id":31,"ref":"vactor-2100-global","sku":null,"data":{"meta":[{"k":"Application","v":"Sewer & Infrastructure"},{"k":"Product Type","v":"Combination Jet/Vac Unit"}],"videos":[],"gallery":["assets/img/vactor/2100-global/g01.webp","assets/img/vactor/2100-global/g02.webp","assets/img/vactor/2100-global/g03.webp","assets/img/vactor/2100-global/g04.webp","assets/img/vactor/2100-global/g05.webp","assets/img/vactor/2100-global/g06.webp","assets/img/vactor/2100-global/g07.webp","assets/img/vactor/2100-global/g08.webp"],"features":["Exclusive Modul-Flex design: debris body capacities from 5 to 15 yd³ (3.8–11.5 m³) configured around the job","Telescoping hydraulic boom extends up to 10 ft (3.45 m) with 180° rotation and 27.6 ft (8.4 m) reach off centreline","JetRodder® water pump with automatic \\"Jack Hammer\\" action, up to 100 GPM at 3,000 PSI — hydraulically driven, no belts","Front-mounted hose reel telescopes 15 in (381 mm) forward and rotates 270° for optimal positioning without moving the truck","Standard high dump: 48 in (1.2 m) single axle / 60 in (1.5 m) tandem axle — unload directly into roll-off containers on site","Choice of vacuum system: single or dual-stage centrifugal compressor (fan) or positive-displacement blower for long-distance pulls","Exclusive aluminium water tanks with 10-year warranty, separate from the debris body for stability and corrosion resistance","E-stops at all operator stations, multi-flow water pump controls, adjustable hose-reel pay-in/pay-out speed"],"downloads":[{"href":"assets/img/vactor/2100-global/brochure.pdf","label":"2100 Global brochure (PDF)"},{"href":"assets/img/vactor/2100-global/tech-specs.pdf","label":"2100 Global technical description (PDF)"}],"applications":["Municipal sanitary sewer mains and stormwater lines","Catch basin cleaning and emergency remediation","Utility daylighting and industrial site clean-up","Long-distance material recovery with PD blower option"],"specifications":[{"k":"Design","v":"Exclusive Vactor Modul-Flex"},{"k":"Air mover","v":"Single or dual-stage centrifugal compressor (fan), or Roots positive-displacement blower"},{"k":"Vacuum rating (PD)","v":"Up to 18 in (457 mm) Hg"},{"k":"Inlet volume (PD)","v":"Up to 4,500 CFM at 0 in Hg"},{"k":"Centrifugal fan","v":"38 in (965 mm) aluminium, single-stage 125 HP / dual-stage 185 HP auxiliary diesel engine"},{"k":"Debris body capacity","v":"5 – 15 yd³ (3.8 – 11.5 m³) Ex-Ten steel"},{"k":"Debris body dump","v":"50° tilt, double-acting hydraulic cylinder; high dump standard"},{"k":"Water tank","v":"1,000 – 1,500 gal (3,785 – 5,678 L) aluminium, 10-year warranty"},{"k":"Water pump","v":"Vactor JetRodder® Multi-Flow, up to 100 GPM at 3,000 PSI"},{"k":"Pump action","v":"Continuous flow or Jack Hammer"},{"k":"Boom","v":"Telescoping hydraulic, 180° rotation, 27.6 ft (8.4 m) reach; 20 ft (6 m) depth with extensions"},{"k":"Pickup hose","v":"8 in (203 mm) diameter"},{"k":"Hose reel","v":"15 in telescope, 270° rotation, 800 ft × 1 in (244 m × 25 mm)"},{"k":"Rear door","v":"Flat, hinged at top, rod-and-receiver sequential locking, hydraulic open/close"},{"k":"Hand gun system","v":"35 ft (10.7 m) hose, 20 GPM at 600 PSI washdown gun"},{"k":"Electrical","v":"Vapour-sealed to NEMA 4 standards, LED stop/tail/turn/clearance lights"}]},"slug":"vactor-2100-global","name_ar":null,"name_en":"2100 Global","type_ar":"وحدة مشتركة لتنظيف الصرف والضخ بالمياه عالية الضغط","type_en":"Combination sewer cleaner & jetting truck","brand_id":3,"category":"environmental","position":5,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-10-06T08:11:35.000Z","hero_image":"assets/img/vactor/2100-global/g01.webp","updated_at":"2026-10-06T08:11:35.000Z","subcategory":"Combination Units","store_hidden":0,"description_ar":"أقوى وحدة مشتركة لتنظيف الصرف في العالم للأسواق الدولية: صناديق مخلفات Modul-Flex حتى 11.5 م³، وضخ مائي عالي الضغط بطلمبة JetRodder® بخاصية Jack Hammer، واختيار بين نظام شفط بالمروحة أو بالإزاحة الموجبة.","description_en":"The world’s most powerful combination sewer cleaner for international markets: Modul-Flex debris bodies up to 15 yd³, JetRodder® high-pressure jetting with Jack Hammer action, and a choice of centrifugal or positive-displacement vacuum systems."}', 1, '2026-10-06 11:17:06'),
(276, 'product', 5, '{"id":5,"ref":"guzzler-classic","sku":null,"data":{"meta":[{"k":"Application","v":"Industrial Vacuum"},{"k":"Product Type","v":"Heavy-Duty Vacuum Loader"}],"videos":[{"ar":"Guzzler — المتانة التي تثق بها","en":"Guzzler — The Tough You Trust","len":"0:32","src":"assets/video/guzzler/classic/tough-you-trust.mp4","poster":"assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-hose.jpg"},{"ar":"الـ Guzzler Classic في الميدان","en":"The Guzzler Classic in the field","yt":"x-VBxoKowYA","poster":"assets/video/guzzler/classic/in-the-field.jpg"},{"ar":"الـ Guzzler Classic أثناء الشغل","en":"The Guzzler Classic at work","yt":"v0rG7jM1JuM","poster":"assets/video/guzzler/classic/offloading.jpg"}],"gallery":["assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-quarry-load.jpg","assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-hose.jpg","assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-dump.jpg","assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-rear-plant.jpg","assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-side.jpg","assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-blower.jpg","assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-refinery.jpg","assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-white-front.jpg","assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-white-side.jpg","assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-white-front-2.jpg","assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-white-rear.jpg"],"related":["vactor-2100i","elgin-crosswind","elgin-whirlwind"],"features":["Recovers solids, dry bulk powders, liquids and heavy slurries without reconfiguring the machine","Four-stage filtration: the first two stages alone remove 98% of material from the airstream","Cyclone doubles as a demister on wet work, and empties together with the main payload","All filter components fully accessible, with a single central hydraulic manifold for servicing","Sealed aluminium instrument panel: blower tachometer and temperature, hourmeter, hydraulic, vacuum and air gauges","E-Stop at the operator stations cuts vacuum and hydraulics and throttles the chassis engine down","Optional full-opening rear door for easier dumping and clean-out"],"downloads":[{"href":"assets/img/guzzler/classic/brochure.pdf","label":"Guzzler Classic brochure (PDF)"}],"applications":["Petroleum refineries and chemical plants","Cement, steel, and lime manufacturing","Power plant fly-ash and boiler cleaning","Environmental disaster remediation"],"specifications":[{"k":"Vacuum blower","v":"Positive displacement, dual-lobe or tri-lobe"},{"k":"Vacuum range","v":"16 – 27 in Hg"},{"k":"Airflow range","v":"5,089 – 5,250 CFM"},{"k":"Debris body volume","v":"18 cu yd (13.76 m³)"},{"k":"Debris body construction","v":"1/4 in (6.35 mm) wall, 1/2 in (12.7 mm) rear door on three heavy-duty hinges"},{"k":"Filtration","v":"Four stages: debris body, cyclone chamber, baghouse (9.94:1 air-to-cloth), microstrainer"},{"k":"Bag cleaning","v":"120 psi pulsation system"},{"k":"Telescoping boom (optional)","v":"Pendant reach 55 ft (16.8 m), stored with the hose attached"},{"k":"Vane pressure offload (optional)","v":"Pressurises the body to 14.5 psi, or draws up to 28.5 in Hg"},{"k":"Hydraulic tank","v":"50 gal (189 L), pump driven from the PTO"},{"k":"Warranty","v":"12 months against defects in material or workmanship"}]},"slug":"guzzler-classic","name_ar":null,"name_en":"Classic","type_ar":"محمّلة شفط صناعي للخدمة الشاقة","type_en":"Heavy-duty industrial vacuum loader","brand_id":4,"category":"environmental","position":6,"published":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T19:47:02.000Z","hero_image":"assets/img/guzzler/classic/gz-refinery.jpg","updated_at":"2026-10-06T08:11:35.000Z","subcategory":"Industrial Vacuums","store_hidden":0,"description_ar":"المعيار الصناعي المُثبَت لسحب المواد الصلبة والمساحيق الجافة والمخاليط الثقيلة والحمأة الصناعية اللزجة عبر مسافات شفط بعيدة.","description_en":"The proven industrial standard for extracting solids, dry bulk powders, heavy slurries, and viscous industrial sludge over extreme suction distances."}', 1, '2026-10-06 11:17:50'),
