ioning"},{"ar":"نطاق قطع الغيار والصيانة","en":"Spare parts and maintenance scope"},{"ar":"دعم ما بعد البيع والضمان","en":"After-sales support and warranty"}],"options":[{"icon":"bolt","label":{"ar":"بيع المولدات","en":"Generator sales"},"value":"power"},{"icon":"truck","label":{"ar":"إيجار المولدات","en":"Generator rental"},"value":"rental"},{"icon":"leaf","label":{"ar":"حلول البيئة","en":"Environmental solutions"},"value":"environmental"},{"icon":"wrench","label":{"ar":"رفع الكفاءة والعمرات","en":"Efficiency upgrades & overhauls"},"value":"repowering"},{"icon":"tool","label":{"ar":"التصنيع والتركيبات","en":"Fabrication & installation"},"value":"engineering"},{"icon":"cube","label":{"ar":"قطع الغيار الأصلية","en":"Genuine spare parts"},"value":"parts"},{"icon":"headset","label":{"ar":"خدمة ما بعد البيع والصيانة","en":"Service & maintenance"},"value":"service"},{"icon":"info","label":{"ar":"أحتاج مساعدة في الاختيار","en":"Help me choose"},"value":"other"}]}', '2026-09-30 22:47:13', '2026-09-30 22:47:13'),
(52, 20, 'linecardJump', NULL, 0, 1, '{"links":[{"href":"#environmental","text":{"ar":"كنس الشوارع وتنظيف الصرف الصحي والبنية التحتية والشفط الصناعي — Elgin و Vactor و Guzzler.","en":"Street sweeping, sewer and infrastructure cleaning, industrial vacuum — Elgin, Vactor, Guzzler."},"title":{"ar":"المعدات البيئية","en":"Environmental Equipment"}},{"href":"#power","text":{"ar":"مولدات ديزل من 10 إلى ⁦2500 kVA⁩، وطاقة للإيجار، ولوحات تحكم وتحويل، وأعمال تصنيع.","en":"Diesel generator sets from 10 to 2500 kVA, rental power, control and transfer panels, fabrication."},"title":{"ar":"توليد الطاقة","en":"Power Generation"}},{"href":"#parts","text":{"ar":"قطع غيار أصلية للمحركات والمولدات ووحدات التحكم والفلاتر، في مخزون دائم.","en":"Genuine engine, alternator, controller and filtration parts held in stocked inventory."},"title":{"ar":"قطع الغيار","en":"Spare Parts"}}],"findHint":{"ar":"بيصفّي القوائم اللي تحت. سيبها فاضية عشان تقرأ المجموعة كاملة.","en":"Filters the lists below. Leave it empty to read the full range."},"findClear":{"ar":"مسح","en":"Clear"},"findLabel":{"ar":"بتدوّر على موديل معيّن؟","en":"Looking for a specific model?"},"findPlaceholder":{"ar":"موديل أو علامة أو تطبيق — مثلاً Pelican أو ⁦500 kVA⁩ أو صرف صحي","en":"Model, brand or application — e.g. Pelican, 500 kVA, sewer"}}', '2026-09-30 22:47:13', '2026-10-20 03:42:08'),
(53, 20, 'linecard', 'environmental', 1, 1, '{"idx":"01","lede":{"ar":"⁦5A&M⁩ هي الوكيل الحصري المعتمد في مصر لمجموعة Federal Signal Environmental Solutions. المجموعات الثلاث تحت بتغطي كنس الشوارع وتنظيف الصرف الصحي والبنية التحتية وأعمال الشفط الصناعي — بتوريد وتشغيل وخدمة من نفس الفريق.","en":"5A&M is the exclusive authorised dealer in Egypt for Federal Signal Environmental Solutions Group. The three ranges below cover street sweeping, sewer and infrastructure cleaning, and industrial vacuum work — supplied, commissioned and serviced by the same team."},"tone":"paper","title":{"ar":"ثلاث وكالات، وجهة تواصل واحدة","en":"Three agencies, one point of contact"},"anchor":"environmental","eyebrow":{"ar":"المعدات البيئية","en":"Environmental Equipment"},"deciding":["Capacity","Hopper capacity","Debris body capacity","Water capacity","Maximum sweep path","Sweep path","Pump performance","Blower performance","Vacuum performance","Rating","Item range","Brands supported","Brands supplied"],"brandBlocks":[{"subs":["Mechanical Sweepers","Regenerative Air","Vacuum Sweepers"],"blurb":{"ar":"مكانس شوارع مبنية على تصاميم بيجري تطويرها باستمرار من 1914. فرشاة ميكانيكية أو هواء متجدد أو شفط خالص — والاختيار بيتحدد حسب نوع المخلفات والمسار وقواعد الأتربة اللي بتشتغل تحتها.","en":"Street sweepers built on designs continuously improved since 1914. Mechanical broom, regenerative air and pure vacuum — the choice depends on the debris, the route and the dust rules you work under."},"brand":"elgin"},{"subs":["Combination Units","Catch Basin Cleaners","Sewer Cleaners","Water Recyclers"],"blurb":{"ar":"منظفات صرف صحي مركّبة وماكينات بيارات التصريف وأجهزة نفث مائي. ولما الشاسيه ميقدرش يوصل للخط مباشرة، ماكينة الخطوط الخلفية بتقدر.","en":"Combination sewer cleaners, catch basin machines and water jetters. Where a truck cannot reach the line directly, the easement machine can."},"brand":"vactor"},{"subs":["Industrial Vacuums","High-Capacity Units","Wet/Dry Units","Custom Solutions"],"blurb":{"ar":"شفاطات تحميل صناعية للمواد الصلبة والمساحيق والسوائل والحمأة الكثيفة — وفيها وحدات مجهّزة لموقع واحد أو لمادة واحدة بعينها.","en":"Industrial vacuum loaders for solids, powders, liquids and thick sludge — including units configured for a single site or a single material."},"brand":"guzzler"}]}', '2026-09-30 22:47:13', '2026-10-20 03:42:08'),
(54, 20, 'linecard', 'power', 2, 1, '{"idx":"02","lede":{"ar":"المولدات مش أصناف كتالوج. ⁦5A&M⁩ بتجمّع كل مولد من مكونات محرك ومولد كهربائي ووحدة تحكم أصلية، في الكابينة اللي الموقع محتاجها، وبتشغّله في الموقع. القدرات تحت هي المدى اللي بنبني فيه — والمواصفة بتتحدد حسب حِملك.","en":"Generator sets are not catalogue items. 5A&M assembles each one from genuine engine, alternator and controller components, in the enclosure the site needs, and commissions it on site. The ratings below are the range we build across — the specification is set against your load."},"title":{"ar":"بنبنيه هنا، على الحِمل اللي قدامنا","en":"Built here, to the load in front of us"},"anchor":"power","groups":[{"note":{"ar":"أساسي أو احتياطي، مبني بمكونات محرك ومولد كهربائي ووحدة تحكم أصلية ومجهَّز حسب الموقع. اختار أقرب قدرة عشان تشوف المواصفة؛ والمقاس النهائي بيتحدد على حِملك.","en":"Prime or standby, built with genuine engine, alternator and controller components and configured to the site. Pick the nearest rating for the specification; the final size is set against your load."},"subs":["Generator Sets"],"style":"ratings","title":{"ar":"مولدات الكهرباء — من 10 إلى ⁦2500 kVA⁩","en":"Generator sets — 10 to 2500 kVA"},"category":"power"},{"note":{"ar":"يُسلَّم جاهز للتشغيل، مع التركيب والصيانة الوقائية طوال مدة الإيجار.","en":"Delivered ready to operate, with installation and preventive maintenance for the rental period."},"subs":["Rental Generators"],"style":"ratings","title":{"ar":"مولدات الإيجار — من 20 إلى ⁦1000 kVA⁩","en":"Rental generators — 20 to 1000 kVA"},"category":"power"},{"subs":["ATS","Synchronization","Control Panels"],"style":"rows","title":{"ar":"التحكم والتحويل","en":"Control and transfer"},"category":"power"},{"subs":["Accessories","Fuel Systems"],"style":"rows","title":{"ar":"التصنيع والملحقات","en":"Fabrication and accessories"},"category":"power"}],"eyebrow":{"ar":"توليد الطاقة","en":"Power Generation"},"deciding":["Capacity","Hopper capacity","Debris body capacity","Water capacity","Maximum sweep path","Sweep path","Pump performance","Blower performance","Vacuum performance","Rating","Item range","Brands supported","Brands supplied"]}', '2026-09-30 22:47:13', '2026-10-20 03:42:08'),
(55, 20, 'linecard', 'parts', 3, 1, '{"idx":"03","lede":{"ar":"قطع غيار محركات ومولدات كهربائية ووحدات تحكم وقطع كهربائية وفلاتر، للمعدات اللي بنوردّها ولأساطيل إحنا مبعناهاش. محفوظة في مخزون دائم، لأن قطعة بتوصل بعد تلات أسابيع مش قطعة غيار.","en":"Engine, alternator, controller, electrical and filtration parts for the equipment we supply and for fleets we did not sell. Held in stocked inventory, because a part that arrives in three weeks is not a spare part."},"tone":"paper","title":{"ar":"قطع غيار أصلية، موجودة على الرف","en":"Genuine parts, on the shelf"},"anchor":"parts","groups":[{"style":"rows","title":{"ar":"القطع والفلاتر اللي بنحتفظ بيها","en":"Parts and filtration we hold"},"category":"parts"}],"eyebrow":{"ar":"قطع الغيار","en":"Spare Parts"},"deciding":["Capacity","Hopper capacity","Debris body capacity","Water capacity","Maximum sweep path","Sweep path","Pump performance","Blower performance","Vacuum performance","Rating","Item range","Brands supported","Brands supplied"],"brandCells":["perkins","cummins","hyundai","volvo","develon","stamford","leroysomer","dse","comap","fleetguard","schneider"]}', '2026-09-30 22:47:13', '2026-10-20 03:42:08'),
(56, 20, 'ctaband', NULL, 4, 1, '{"cta":{"ar":"اطلب عرض سعر","en":"Request a quote"},"img":"assets/img/photos/site-installation.jpg","figs":[{"icon":"shield","text":{"ar":"وكيل Federal Signal في مصر","en":"Federal Signal dealer in Egypt"},"count":null,"title":{"ar":"حصري","en":"Exclusive"}},{"icon":"cube","text":{"ar":"أقصى قدرة للمولد","en":"Maximum set rating"},"count":{"to":2500,"suffix":" kVA"}},{"icon":"layers","text":{"ar":"تصنيع وتركيب","en":"Fabrication & installation"},"count":null,"title":{"ar":"داخلياً","en":"In-house"}},{"icon":"clock","text":{"ar":"على المعدات المسلَّمة","en":"On delivered equipment"},"count":null,"title":{"ar":"الضمان","en":"Warranty"}}],"text":{"ar":"وصّف الموقع والحِمل والظروف. إحنا بنحدد الماكينة ونطاق قطع الغيار وخطة الخدمة حواليها.","en":"Describe the site, the load and the conditions. We specify the machine, the parts scope and the service plan around it."},"title":{"ar":"قول لنا التطبيق،","en":"Tell us the application,"},"accent":{"ar":"مش رقم القطعة","en":"not the part number"}}', '2026-09-30 22:47:13', '2026-10-20 03:42:08'),
